{"id":"lele-144","title":"202212 青少年软件编程等级考试Scratch二级真题","subject":"scratch","subjectName":"电子学会Scratch","level":2,"yearmonth":"202212","year":"2022","count":37,"questions":[{"no":1,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"一个骰子，从3个不同角度看过去的点数如图所示，请问5的对面是什么点数？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818881983312.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：1"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：3"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：4"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：6"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"根据图三，用右手定则，大拇指朝上指向6所对的方向，其余四指握起来表示旋转方向，可以看到先5后2，然后把这个姿势对应到图1中，就知道1的对面是5，4的对面是2。","auto":true},{"no":2,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"明明想做一个大鱼吃小鱼的游戏，下列哪个程序能实现鲨鱼吃到小黄鱼变大10，吃到小红鱼变大20，吃到小蓝鱼变大30？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818883016739.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818883169409.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818883271415.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818883375620.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818883462349.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"考点：条件语句 解析：根据题意共分为三种情况：1.鲨鱼吃到小黄鱼变大10；2.鲨鱼吃到小红鱼变大20；3.鲨鱼吃到小蓝鱼变大30。C选项如果那么条件成立可以满足1，否则中还有两个条件，第一个碰到小红鱼可以满足2，第二个碰到小蓝鱼可以满足3。故选C。","auto":true},{"no":3,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"魔法师只有一个造型，下列哪段程序可以实现魔法师念出咒语后，从舞台上消失？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818885683358.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818885932891.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818886218151.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818886307331.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818886388873.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818886484640.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"考点：虚像特效设置 解析：将角色虚像特效设定为100的时候，角色透明度为100，在舞台上完全消失。","auto":true},{"no":4,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"有四块水果蛋糕，草莓蛋糕比芒果蛋糕大，草莓蛋糕比菠萝蛋糕小，菠萝蛋糕比火龙果蛋糕小。蛋糕按照从大到小的顺序排列，正确的是？（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：菠萝，草莓，芒果，火龙果"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：菠萝，草莓，火龙果，芒果"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：火龙果，菠萝，草莓，芒果"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：火龙果，菠萝，芒果，草莓"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":null,"auto":true},{"no":5,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小玉爸爸、小敏爸爸和小霞爸爸三人中有一位教师、一位医生、一位司机，现在只知道，小霞爸爸比司机年龄大，小玉爸爸和医生不同岁，医生比小敏爸爸年龄小。下列说法正确的是？（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：小霞爸爸是教师"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：小敏爸爸是教师"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：小敏爸爸是司机"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：小玉爸爸是医生"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":null,"auto":true},{"no":6,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"观察下图数字规律，“？”处填入的数字应该是？（　）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818888879040.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：7"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：6"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：5"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：4"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":null,"auto":true},{"no":7,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"运行下列程序，角色说的内容是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818889503911.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：202220222022"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：202222"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：42"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：2022"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"“连接”积木会把前后两个白圈中的内容连接起来，为2022，重复执行3次说2022，D选项正确。","auto":true},{"no":8,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"甲壳虫角色，运行下列程序，说法错误的是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818890256371.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：不点击鼠标时，甲壳虫可能会跟随鼠标指针移动"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：不点击鼠标时，甲壳虫可能会不停地变化颜色"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：不点击鼠标时，甲壳虫移动的同时会变化颜色"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：点击鼠标后，甲壳虫不会继续移动"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":null,"auto":true},{"no":9,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"运行下列程序，音量大小调整为？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818891399848.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：40"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：60"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：80"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：100"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"程序运行起始音量大小为100，接着运行4次将音量减少10，最终音量大小为：100-4X10=60。","auto":true},{"no":10,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下列哪个程序可以实现小猫角色位置在舞台上不停地变化，按下空格键后停止移动？（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818892008345.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818892097925.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818892185731.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818892268713.png"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":null,"auto":true},{"no":11,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"运行下列程序，舞台上会显示？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818894296864.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818894461926.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818894554891.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818894643906.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818894751634.png"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"图章就是画出一个跟角色一模一样的图形。因为画出的图形和小猫一模一样，所以不受画笔参数设置的影响，而与小猫的外形有关。“将笔的透明度设为”积木可以设置笔的透明度，但是却不能改变角色的透明度，所以小猫不会改变，图章出的图形也不会改变，D选项正确。","auto":true},{"no":12,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"角色初始方向向右，运行下列程序会绘制出什么图形？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818895174194.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818895343787.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818895437125.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818895577054.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818895659675.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"A,B选项画出图形没有发生透明度的改变，因此排除。画笔在移动作画的过程中，不断地将透明度增加，画出的图形会越来越淡，故C选项正确。","auto":true},{"no":13,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小狗和鸡的位置如下图所示，点击绿旗后，小狗会？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818896063181.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818896341506.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：会“汪”的叫一声"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：“汪”的叫一声 ，同时移动50步"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：没有任何变化"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：移动50步"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"小狗没有碰到鸡，点击绿旗后，小狗会移动50步，D选项正确。","auto":true},{"no":14,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"舞台有多张背景，棒球运动员程序如下图所示，“颜色碰到”积木中的颜色分别为球棒的颜色和棒球的颜色，点击绿旗后，下列选项正确的是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818899077991.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818899184580.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：棒球会一直说“打到了”"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：舞台会不停地切换背景"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：棒球运动员会一直说“打到了”"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：棒球运动员会一直不停地切换造型"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"“颜色碰到颜色”积木需要侦测角色上的颜色是否碰到其他角色身上的颜色，观察所给图形，棒球碰到了球杆，所以棒球运动员会一直说“打到了。”","auto":true},{"no":15,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小猫和小狗在玩球，位置如下图所示，下列程序不能让小猫在碰到球时，说出“我踢到球了！”的是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818900131444.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818900338473.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818900411401.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818900492855.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818900596704.png"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":null,"auto":true},{"no":16,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下列哪个选项的结果大于7？（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818902111986.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818902195025.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818902275816.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818902355832.png"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"A选项结果为3，B选项结果为3，C选项结果为结果2，D选项结果为结果9。故答案选D。","auto":true},{"no":17,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下列哪个选项的结果和下图积木的结果相等？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818902771068.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818902959351.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818903041048.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818903125771.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818903235078.png"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":null,"auto":true},{"no":18,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小猫角色运行下列程序，说法正确的是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818903633132.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：只按下w键，小猫就能向下走"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：要同时按下↑键和w键，小猫才能向上走"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：只按下↑键，小猫就能向上走"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：不按任何键，小猫就能向上走"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"运行程序后，只需按下↑键或者w键，小猫就能向上移动。故选C。","auto":true},{"no":19,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"动物王国要举办森林音乐会，下列哪个程序能实现音乐连续不停地播放，并且每播放一次声音都逐渐减弱？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818904392688.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818904673957.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818904773677.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818904871490.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818904978303.png"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"连续不停地播放音乐要用“播放声音...等待播完”，声音逐渐减弱就是将音量变小，故选D。","auto":true},{"no":20,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"架子鼓和电子琴的程序如下图所示，哪个选项可以让架子鼓和电子琴同时停止声音播放，不再听到任何声音？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818905773758.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818906206922.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818906352057.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818906531956.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818906626284.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818906713056.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818906791598.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"“停止所有声音”只能停止积木执行的一瞬间，停止全部脚本可以停止所有声音，故选C。","auto":true},{"no":21,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小猫初始位置在舞台中心，面向右，运行下列程序，舞台上会显示？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818907261067.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818907446412.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818907547108.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818907638668.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818907734467.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"小猫初始位置在舞台中心，它的坐标为（0，0），点击绿旗运行程序，35小于68，条件不成立，执行如果那么否则积木中的第二个分支，小猫会面向90度，也就是面向右移动100步，最终停留在（100，0）的位置。故B选项正确。","auto":true},{"no":22,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"在“密室寻宝”游戏中，下列哪个积木可以实现将钥匙藏在短袖下？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818915377649.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818915599299.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818915662098.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818915753743.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818915857992.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"需要移动钥匙的图层到短袖的下层，答案选C。","auto":true},{"no":23,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"苹果成熟后会从树上落下来，苹果落到刺猬身上后，会换成切开造型并停止掉落，下列程序不能实现的是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818917389215.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818917616875.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818917723192.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818917811622.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818917902248.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"选项A、B、D中的苹果会不断下落，碰到刺猬身上的颜色后，换成切开造型并停止下落。C选项苹果碰到刺猬后，不会停止下落，错误，故C选项正确。","auto":true},{"no":24,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"妈妈想让小明帮忙买水果，如果有苹果就买苹果，没有苹果就买香蕉，使用下列哪个积木最容易实现？（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818918363133.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818918446301.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818918533430.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818918624601.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"如果有苹果就买苹果，否则就买香蕉，这种用“如果...那么...否则”结构最合适。","auto":true},{"no":25,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小猫想和棕熊打招呼，初始位置如下图所示，两个角色之间的直线距离为300，下列程序不能让小猫走到棕熊面前的是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818919302212.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818919517005.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818919608201.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818919693939.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818919972405.png"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":null,"auto":true},{"no":1,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"这两段程序实现的效果是一样的。（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818920508240.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"两者效果相同。","auto":true},{"no":2,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"14个同学依次报数，报单数的按从小到大站一排，报双数的按从小到大站一排。单数排的第3个同学是5号，双数排的第5个同学是10号。（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"依据题意，单数排的同学，依次报号位为：1、3、5、7、9、11、13；双数排的同学，依次报号位为：2、4、6、8、10、12、14；因此，题干表述正确。","auto":true},{"no":3,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"青蛙是森林中的跳跃高手，点击绿旗后，它会一直上下跳跃，直到按下鼠标，它才会停止。（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818921494411.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818921789327.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"“重复执行直到”积木当条件不满足时，会一直执行循环夹子中的积木，满足条件停止执行。所以青蛙会在没点击鼠标时一直跳跃，点击鼠标后停止跳跃。","auto":true},{"no":4,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"男孩和足球的初始位置如图所示，已知每个格子的边长为30，运行下列这段程序，男孩可以碰到球。（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818922246493.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818922393914.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"男孩与球的距离为4格，程序运行了3次，每格距离为30，男孩向前走两格，无法碰到球。","auto":true},{"no":5,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"运行下列程序，可以绘制出一个红色的正方形。（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818922883947.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"程序中只有抬笔积木，没有落笔，无法画出图形。","auto":true},{"no":6,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"使用下列积木可以判断出是否按下了鼠标。（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818923409024.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"“碰到鼠标指针”积木只能侦测到是否碰到鼠标指针，无法侦测出是否按下了鼠标。","auto":true},{"no":7,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"下列积木的运行结果为true。（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818923903995.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"“34<44”的结果为true，“10除以2的余数=5”的结果为false，false外嵌套了层不成立，因此右边的结果为true，故积木的运行结果为true，所以该题正确。","auto":true},{"no":8,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"点击下图中的“响一点”按钮可以使声音变得大一些。（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818924293918.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"scratch的声音选项卡中的“响一点”可以让音乐的声音变大。","auto":true},{"no":9,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"水母和小丑鱼的位置如左图所示，两个角色中都有右图程序，把鼠标移到角色重叠处按下空格键后，只有小丑鱼会向右移动100步。（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818925057052.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818925179671.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"两个角色碰到鼠标指针后，都会向右移动100步，故答案错误。","auto":true},{"no":10,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"运行下列程序，角色说“不对”。（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818925653715.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"分析程序发现，点击绿旗，程序进入判断，条件为“50>51不成立”，条件满足，执行判断条件内的指令，角色说出“不对”。","auto":true},{"no":1,"type":"问答题","stem":[{"t":"老鹰捉小鸡"},{"t":"小鸡正在农场上玩耍，突然从远处飞来一只老鹰，小鸡要快速回到鸡舍中，躲避老鹰的抓捕。"},{"t":"1.准备工作"},{"t":"(1) 删除默认白色背景，添加背景Farm；"},{"t":"(2) 删除默认角色小猫，添加角色Chick、Griffin。"},{"t":"2.功能实现"},{"t":"(1) 角色的初始位置和方向如下图所示；"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818926745805.png"},{"t":"(2) 老鹰不断向右下移动，碰到边缘就反弹，不能倒立；"},{"t":"(3) 用上、下、左、右键，控制小鸡朝上下左右四个不同的方向移动，不能倒立；"},{"t":"(4) 老鹰碰到小鸡后，老鹰会说“我抓住你了！” 2秒，停止全部脚本；"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818927146889.png"},{"t":"(5) 小鸡走进鸡舍后，会说“我安全啦！”2秒，然后消失，停止全部脚本。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818927372696.png"}],"options":[],"answer":null,"analysis":"： 评分标准： （1）背景和角色添加正确（1分）； （2）点击绿旗后，角色的初始位置正确（1分），方向正确（1分），老鹰不断移动，旋转方式正确，碰到边缘反弹（2分）； （3）按下上、下、左、右键可以让小鸡朝上下左右不同方向移动（2分），旋转方式正确（1分）； （4）老鹰碰到小鸡后，说出“我抓住你了！”（2分），停止全部脚本（1分）； （5）小鸡碰到鸡舍黑色部分后，说出“我安全啦！”（2分），隐藏（1分），停止全部脚本（1分）。","auto":false},{"no":2,"type":"问答题","stem":[{"t":"绘制风车"},{"t":"1.准备工作"},{"t":"(1）隐藏默认的小猫角色；"},{"t":"(2）选择背景：“Xy-grid”。"},{"t":"2.功能实现"},{"t":"(1）小猫角色的初始位置为(x:0,y:0)；"},{"t":"(2）线条粗细为5，三角形的边长为100；"},{"t":"(3）绘制如下图所示的图形，三角形的颜色分别为绿色、红色、橙色，方向和所示图相同。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230419/16818929622131.png"}],"options":[],"answer":null,"analysis":"： 评分标准： （1）完成小猫角色的隐藏，将小猫的位置初始化为(x:0,y:0)；（2分） （2）完成画笔的粗细设置，并落笔绘制；（2分） （3）完成一个边长为100的三角形的绘制；（4分） （4）完成三个三角形的绘制；（3分） （5）三角形的颜色分别为绿色、红色、橙色（2分）；方向和所示图相同（2分）。","auto":false}],"durationMin":60,"totalScore":100,"passScore":60,"source":"leledati","tags":{"year":"2022","type":"真题","progress":"未开始"}}